  "_readme": "Stamp metadata. One SVG per stamp, drawn at any size in any viewBox. Paths carry data-role=\"ink|paper|shadow\" (or class=, or an inferred role from the fill lightness): ink takes the player's crayon colour, paper and shadow come from the paper stock the cutout is made of. \"layer\" is \"on\" (clipped to the cutout) or \"behind\" (glued behind, may hang outside it). Then: npm run stamps:compile.",
